.TH IMPROV-SERVE-REFRESH 1 "" "improv" "Improv Manual"
.SH NAME
improv\-serve\-refresh \- Refresh measures as their refresh policies fall due, until interrupted
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimprov serve\-refresh\fR [OPTIONS] <db> [source.sqlite]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Refresh measures as their refresh policies fall due, until interrupted.
.PP
On every tick: on\-load measures once, interval:N measures every N seconds. SQL\-backed measures refresh only when a source is given.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tick\fR \fI<SECS>\fR [default: 5]
Seconds between ticks
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIdb\fR>
The model store: a file, or postgres://USER@HOST/DB?model=NAME
.TP
[\fIsource.sqlite\fR]
The SQLite database the SQL\-backed measures query
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR improv (1).
